## Architecture Diagram

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[Trigger Input<br>Simulated Trigger / Break Beam Sensor]
    B[Arduino Uno]
    C[Event Detection Logic]
    D[Timestamp Generation<br>millis()]
    E[Serial Output]
    F[Validation / Log Review]

    A --> B
    B --> C
    C --> D
    D --> E
    E --> F